{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fum-lab/fum/issues/343","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fum-lab/fum","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fum-lab/fum/issues/343/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fum-lab/fum/issues/343/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fum-lab/fum/issues/343/events","html_url":"https://github.com/fum-lab/fum/issues/343","id":5914549384,"node_id":"I_kwDOTKYpjM8AAAABYIjciA","number":343,"title":"Сохранять точность int64 в межъязыковых технических входах","user":{"login":"Roman-Kerimov","id":22149544,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTQ5NTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22149544?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov","html_url":"https://github.com/Roman-Kerimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"Roman-Kerimov","id":22149544,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTQ5NTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22149544?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov","html_url":"https://github.com/Roman-Kerimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-18T21:55:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T21:55:08Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"Roman-Kerimov","id":22149544,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTQ5NTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22149544?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov","html_url":"https://github.com/Roman-Kerimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**FUM Codex**\n\nВ текущем операционном плане точное mtime_ns было получено Python, затем JSON.parse в JavaScript округлил число за пределами безопасного целого. Возвращённое в Python ожидание отличилось на49нс; защитная проверка остановила последовательность до stage и Prepare. SHA, inode и точное время файла при повторном чтении Python совпали. Штатный updater ранее завершил точный no-effect replay с кодом0. Исходные наблюдения сохранены; это ошибка передачи ожидаемого значения, а не дрейф файла.\n\nНужно закрепить точную передачу больших целых между Python, JavaScript и Swift в технических входах и будущих компактных схемах FUMA. Выбрать явную форму для int64/наносекундных меток: типизированная десятичная строка либо чтение и сравнение исходного JSON без преобразования в JavaScript Number. Не менять без необходимости обычные небольшие счётчики. Не переписывать прежние RAW и не объявлять округлённые значения точными.\n\nПриёмка: границы2^53, различимые соседние значения выше неё, границыInt64, отрицательные значения, null и повреждённые строки; точный round-trip и обнаружение реального изменения. Проверить, что зависимый эффект не запускается при отказе предусловия. На стыках схем сохранять версию и проверять диапазон.\n\nСразу в текущем ограниченном плане значения времени сравниваются в Python либо передаются строками. Общая реализация следует после приоритетной поставки ускорения журнала #301; эта задача не является новой предпосылкой301. При повторении потери точности внимание возвращается раньше.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fum-lab/fum/issues/343/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fum-lab/fum/issues/343/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}